  "description": "EVERYTHING YOU WANT, NOTHING YOU DON'T\nYou’ve logged enough saddle time to know the difference. You’ve watched with appreciation as TIME bikes roll past. You’ve ridden multiple bikes and know that ride feel is more than marketing language, it’s the thing you’re actually chasing.\nBuilt on proven TIME Braided Carbon Structure (BCS) carbon with a new Scylon-inspired fork, NXR delivers the signature ride quality we’ve refined for decades in a package that makes the decision easy. A geometry that responds instantly to your input – 32mm tire clearance for the roads you actually ride – Jewel-tone transparent finishes that let the carbon weave speak for itself. Pure Road is everything you want from NXR – nothing you don’t.\nPure Road Design - Born from Alpe d'Huez",
